           <i class=\"ti ti-building-museum\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                        <div class=\"topbar-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-3-1\">\n                            Adwa Victory Memorial Museum\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topbar-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-3-2\">\n                            / SMRMP / Maintenance\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"operational\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-4\">\n                        <span class=\"operational-dot\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-4-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Operational\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"topbar-right\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"top-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                            Search requests, assets…\n                        </span>\n                        <kbd data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                            ⌘K\n                        </kbd>\n                    </div>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Open notifications\" class=\"icon-btn\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-bell\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"user-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-3-1\">\n                            Aster Tadesse\n                        </strong>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Maintenance Officer\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-4\">\n                        AT\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            <main class=\"workspace\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\">\n                <section class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" id=\"dashboard\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                        <div class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                            Maintenance operations / Daawwannaa · ጥገና\n                        </div>\n                        <h1 data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                            Asset risk observatory\n                        </h1>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                            Protect every object, room, and system that keeps the Adwa story alive. Triage incidents, assign care, and close the loop with evidence.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"hero-context\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-4\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-4-1\">\n                                Today\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-4-2\">\n                                Monday, 25 November 2024\n                            </strong>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-4-3\">\n                                •\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-4-4\">\n                                Preventive care window · 09:00–17:00\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                        <div class=\"response-box\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"response-top\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    Emergency response\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"emergency response readiness percentage\" data-reason=\"value updated dynamically by system\">\n                                    86% ready\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"response-bar\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"emergency response bar progress\" data-reason=\"width updated dynamically by system based on readiness score\">\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"response-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                                2 active incidents · Fire & facilities teams on standby\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2\" style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;justify-content:flex-end\">\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-gold\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                Create request\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-quiet\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                Emergency cases\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"section-head\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                            Museum asset health\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                            One calm view of conservation, equipment uptime, and building readiness.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"section-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-2\" href=\"#reports\">\n                        Open monthly briefing\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <section class=\"health-grid\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3\">\n                    <article class=\"panel health-feature\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                        <img alt=\"Conservator inspecting a museum artifact, Tahir Xəlfəquliyev on Pexels\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/33656462/pexels-photo-33656462.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=900&q=80\"/>\n                        <div class=\"health-feature-content\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    <h3 data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        Artifact conservation\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        74 objects under active inspection\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-vase\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"health-score\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"score-number\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"conservation score value\" data-reason=\"number updated dynamically by system\">\n                                        82\n                                        <small data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                            /100\n                                        </small>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"score-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                            Stable with watch items\n                                        </strong>\n                                        Humidity variance in North Gallery is the only critical conservation signal.\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"health-meter\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"conservation score bar progress\" data-reason=\"width updated dynamically by system\">\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"panel panel-pad\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-2\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-2-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-2-1-1\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    Equipment uptime\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-2-1