\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-5-2\">\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-5-2-1\">\n                                        Repair completed\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-5-2-2\">\n                                        HVAC sensor · waiting for verification\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"notification-time\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-5-3\">\n                                    yest.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"notification\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6\">\n                                <span class=\"notification-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"notification-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6-2\">\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6-2-1\">\n                                        Request closed\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6-2-2\">\n                                        Emergency lighting test · AWM-2026-0097\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"notification-time\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-2-2-6-3\">\n                                    Nov 22\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"panel panel-pad\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3\" id=\"emergency\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-1\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-1-1\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-1-1-1\">\n                                    Response contacts\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-1-1-2\">\n                                    Emergency readiness · 24/7 escalation\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-phone-call\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-1-2\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2\" style=\"margin-top:13px;padding:11px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--white)\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-1\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n                                <span class=\"operational\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-1-1\" style=\"padding:4px 7px;background:rgba(228,238,220,.12);border-color:rgba(212,160,23,.4);color:#D9E7B7\">\n                                    <span class=\"operational-dot\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-1-1-1\" style=\"background:#D9E7B7\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    On call\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-1-2\" style=\"font-size:10px\">\n                                    Emergency desk\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-2\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:11px;font:700 23px/1 'Playfair Display',serif;color:#F9E29A\">\n                                +251 11 447 2186\n                            </strong>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-2-3\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:4px;color:rgba(255,253,249,.62);font-size:8px\">\n                                Security desk · building response · fire safety\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-3\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-3-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-shield\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-3-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                Security Team\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-3-2\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">\n                                2 min response\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-4\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-4-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-flame\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-4-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                Fire safety lead\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-9-3-4-2\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">\n                                4 min response\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-10\">\n                    SMRMP Maintenance Management · Asset Risk Observatory ·\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-10-1\" lang=\"om\">\n                        Hojii tajaajila mana kuusaa\n                    </span>\n                    ·\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-10-2\" lang=\"am\">\n                        የሙዚየም ጥገና አስተዳደር\n                    </span>\n                    · Photo credits: Tahir Xəlfəquliyev, Pew Nguyen, Blackcurrant Great, and José Andrés Pacheco Cortes on Pexels.\n                </div>\n            </main>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
