eep every story safe, operational, and ready.\n                        </h1>\n                        <p class=\"hero-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"hero paragraph text\">\n                            A single command center for reviewing requests, protecting artifacts, coordinating technicians, and keeping the Adwa museum open without interruption.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"hero-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"hero metadata list\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"hero meta calendar date\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-calendar\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\" style=\"font-size:14px;width:14px;height:14px;color:#E6C96D;line-height:1;\">\n                                </i>\n                                Monday, 25 November 2024\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"hero meta location\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\" style=\"font-size:14px;width:14px;height:14px;color:#E6C96D;line-height:1;\">\n                                </i>\n                                Main campus · 4 active zones\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"hero meta response SLA\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\" style=\"font-size:14px;width:14px;height:14px;color:#BBD899;line-height:1;\">\n                                </i>\n                                Response SLA 92%\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"hero-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"hero ac